[1;1H[1m[;m  [;mframe/header concatenation or invoking a hash. Empty bytes are valid. These[22m   [2;1H[1m[;m  [;mare[22m                                                                           [3;1H[1m[;m  [;mthe only helper refusal codes. There is no caller-supplied frame parser.[22m      [4;1H[1m[;m  [22m[;m                                                                              [5;1H[1m[;m  [;m## Immutable profile[22m                                                          [6;1H[1m[;m  [22m[;m                                                                              [7;1H[1m[;m  [;mCODE_GIT_PROFILE_LIMITS is a `types.MappingProxyType` wrapping a fresh literal[8;1H[;m  [;mdict, with no separately exposed mutable backing dict. Its insertion order and[9;1H[;m  [;mvalues are exactly:[22m                                                           [10;1H[1m[;m  [22m[;m                                                                              [11;1H[1m[;m  [;m```text[22m                                                                       [12;1H[1m[;m  [;mmax_targets: 32[22m                                                               [13;1H[1m[;m  [;mmax_objects: 2048[22m                                                             [14;1H[1m[;m  [;mmax_tree_entries: 32768[22m                                                       [15;1H[1m[;m  [;mmax_object_bytes: 8388608[22m                                                     [16;1H[1m[;m  [;mmax_total_object_bytes: 33554432[22m                                              [17;1H[1m[;m  [;m```[22m                                                                           [18;1H[1m[;m  [22m[;m                                                                              [19;1H[1m[;m  [;mItem assignment/deletion and mutable-map operations cannot change it. Callers[22m [20;1H[1m[;m  [;muse `dict(CODE_GIT_PROFILE_LIM