[1;1H[1m[;m  [;m## Closed errors and result construction[22m                                      [2;1H[1m[;m  [22m[;m                                                                              [3;1H[1m[;m  [;mExactly the ten `CODE_PROOF_*` codes in the R1 error table are exposed. Short[22m [4;1H[1m[;m  [;muppercase phrases such as TYPE_MISMATCH, COMMIT_INVALID or TREE_INVALID in[22m    [5;1H[1m[;m  [;mexplanatory prose denote their fully prefixed code in that table; they are not[6;1H[;m  [;madditional error strings. The wrong-type code is[22m                              [7;1H[1m[;m  [;mCODE_PROOF_OBJECT_TYPE_MISMATCH, with oid/expected_type/actual_type context.[22m  [8;1H[1m[;m  [22m[;m                                                                              [9;1H[1m[;m  [;mConstruct success dicts in the key order shown by R1's exact success result.[22m  [10;1H[1m[;m  [;mConstruct object_records in the five-field declaration order. Construct blob[22m  [11;1H[1m[;m  [;msubrecords as oid, body_size_bytes, body_sha256, framed_sha256. The budget,[22m   [12;1H[1m[;m  [;mtarget, walk-edge and stopped_at orders are also exactly as displayed in R1.[22m  [13;1H[1m[;m  [;mPreserve the already defined list ordering. Future saved documents use their[22m  [14;1H[1m[;m  [;mown JCS wire contract; these return values do not themselves supply saved-byte[15;1H[;m  [;midentity or a public envelope.[22m                                                [16;1H[1m[;m  [22m[;m                                                                              [17;1H[1m[;m  [;mFor a missing component, **name_hex is not null**: it is the exact attempted[22m  [18;1H[1m[;m  [;mcomponent's ASCII bytes in lowercase hex. The chosen complete shape is:[22m       [19;1H[1m[;m  [22m[;m                                                                              [20;1H[1m[;m  [;m```text[22m                  